10
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:43,010
Many of them were buried in Master's medicine garden

11
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:47,010
Elder Danyangzi really seems to be able to do such a thing.

12
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:48,610
Now that it is clear

13
00:00:48,610 --> 00:01:00,610
